   "source": [
    "# 🎙️ DubYou — Real-Time Identity-Preserving Voice Dubbing\n",
    "> Same voice. Different language. Under 500 ms.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture:** VAD → STT (Deepgram/Whisper) → Translate (Gemini/NLLB) → TTS (Qwen3/Parler)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### ⚡ Runtime: Set to **GPU (T4)** in `Runtime → Change runtime type`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cell 1 — Clone the Repository"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!git clone https://github.com/gaur3009-p/dubbing.git /content/dubbing"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cell 2 — Install System Dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!apt-get update -qq\n",
    "!apt-get install -y -qq ffmpeg libsndfile1 portaudio19-dev"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cell 3 — Install Python Requirements"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install -q -r /content/dubbing/app/requirements.txt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cell 4 — Set API Keys & Environment Variables\n",
    "\n",
    "> 🔑 Fill in your keys below.\n",
    "> - `DEEPGRAM_API_KEY` → https://console.deepgram.com (free tier available)\n",
    "> - `GEMINI_API_KEY`   → https://aistudio.google.com (free tier available)\n",
    "> - Leave blank to use **free local fallbacks** (faster-whisper + NLLB-200) — slower but no keys needed."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── STT: Deepgram Nova-3 (fast) OR leave blank → faster-whisper fallback ──\n",
    "os.environ[\"DEEPGRAM_API_KEY\"] = \"\"   # <-- paste your key here\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Translation: Gemini 1.5 Flash (fast) OR leave blank → NLLB-200 fallback ──\n",
    "os.environ[\"GEMINI_API_KEY\"]   = \"\"   # <-- paste your key here\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Target dubbing language (default: Hindi) ─────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Other options: spa_Latn (Spanish), fra_Latn (French), deu_Latn (German), etc.\n",
    "os.environ[\"DUBBING_TARGET_LANG\"] = \"hin_Deva\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── LiveKit (optional — leave blank to run in Gradio demo mode) ──────────────\n",
    "os.environ[\"LIVEKIT_URL\"]        = \"\"\n",
    "os.environ[\"LIVEKIT_API_KEY\"]    = \"\"\n",
    "os.environ[\"LIVEKIT_API_SECRET\"] = \"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Environment variables set.\")\n",
    "print(f\"   STT  : {'Deepgram Nova-3' if os.environ['DEEPGRAM_API_KEY'] else "faster-whisper (local fallback)"}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Trans: {'Gemini 1.5 Flash' if os.environ['GEMINI_API_KEY'] else "NLLB-200 (local fallback)"}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Lang : {os.environ['DUBBING_TARGET_LANG']}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cell 5 — Add App to Python Path"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, \"/content/dubbing/app\")\n",
    "print(\"✅ /content/dubbing/app added to sys.path\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
