    "\n",
    "> A **public shareable link** will appear below. Click it to open the DubYou UI in your browser.\n",
    "> The app runs in Gradio demo mode (no LiveKit needed)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
